      {"q": "Does StudyMonkey help with essay writing?", "a": "Yes, but the essay writer feature is only included starting with the Pro plan ($13/month) and above."},
      {"q": "What subjects does StudyMonkey cover?", "a": "StudyMonkey supports 100+ subjects, including math, science, language, history, and computer science, with the free plan limited to 5 subjects."},
