                      'also ask its chat assistant questions across past meetings and connected apps. Higher tiers add CRM sync, admin analytics and, on '
                      "Enterprise, SSO, an API and webhooks. Its accuracy in noisy or crosstalk-heavy calls was not something I could verify from the vendor's "
                      'site.',
