                                {'title': 'Sequences and dialer', 'desc': 'Email-based outreach sequences plus a parallel dialer for calling.'},
                                {'title': 'Deliverability tools', 'desc': 'Domain warming, inbox rotation and reputation monitoring to protect sending.'},
