                                {'title': 'Enablement and coaching', 'desc': 'Gong Enable builds training and coaching around real customer conversations.'},
                                {'title': 'AI agents', 'desc': 'Agents act on revenue data, for example editing pipeline fields or correcting forecasts.'},
