      {"q": "Can teams collaborate within Designs.ai?", "a": "Higher-tier and enterprise plans generally support team seats and shared brand assets."},
      {"q": "What languages does the voice generator support?", "a": "The voice-over tool supports multiple languages and various synthetic voice styles for narration."},
      {"q": "Are exported files commercially licensed?", "a": "Paid plans generally include commercial usage rights for generated assets, subject to Designs.ai's terms of service."}
