      {"title": "Embeddable branded widget", "desc": "A chat widget can be added to any website via a short script and customized to match brand colors and tone."},
      {"title": "Analytics dashboard", "desc": "Tracks conversation volume, common questions, and unanswered queries to help identify content gaps."},
      {"title": "Lead capture", "desc": "Collects visitor name, email, or other contact details during chat conversations for follow-up."},
      {"title": "Multi-language responses", "desc": "The chatbot can respond to visitors in multiple languages based on the underlying content and configuration."}
