      {"q": "Can generated designs be edited afterward?", "a": "Yes, historically the platform allowed editing and refining generated designs rather than only producing static output."},
      {"q": "What types of screens can it generate?", "a": "It has supported generating mobile app screens, web pages, and dashboard layouts, among others."},
      {"q": "Is there a paid plan?", "a": "Consistent public self-serve pricing has not been reliably available since 2024; access has largely been limited to a waitlist."},
      {"q": "Who founded Galileo AI?", "a": "It was founded by a small team who, according to reports, joined Google in an acquihire in 2024, affecting the product's independent development."}
